OL,3,GNEWSAObsessed man took 'brutal and
OL,4,Afatal revenge', jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "obsessed" former university student
OL,7,Fmurdered his sex worker ex-girlfriend
OL,8,Fafter she realised he had stolen money
OL,9,Ffrom her, a jury has heard.
OL,11,FThe Old Bailey was told how 24-year-old
OL,12,FDeepak Sandhu killed 39-year-old
OL,13,FXiaoqing Ke in a "ferocious" knife
OL,14,Fattack at her Air BnB flat in the Earls
OL,15,FCourt area of London.
OL,17,FCaroline Carberry KC said Sandhu, of
OL,18,FNewlands Road, Southampton, and Ms Ke,
OL,19,Fwho was from China, had got to know one
OL,20,Fanother in early 2025 when she was
OL,21,Fworking at a brothel.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
